/users/GQAdonis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":25407584,"digest":"sha256:fec29ccff678660cd1b27af8cfd74aba016881507442e943c223fd09f5c2dc0a","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T15:14:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T15:14:56Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/releases/download/v0.4.0/operational-assurance-packet.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/releases/assets/674325725","id":674325725,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQkMxIc4oMWTd","name":"seed-initial.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"GQAdonis","id":100990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDk5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis","html_url":"https://github.com/GQAdonis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GQAdonis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":8868510,"digest":"sha256:d1f6ea9a25497ccb630fd940aeddc3a87454aa3e17507d33767d5e2fd968e550","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-25T06:54:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T06:54:19Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/releases/download/v0.4.0/seed-initial.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/tarball/v0.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/zipball/v0.4.0","body":"Seven Rust crates advance together to 0.4.0; `prometheus-parking-lot-ffi` remains unpublished.\n\nThis release adds mailbox-address-scoped result idempotency, stored terminal outcomes after durable redelivery, settlement when a spawner discards accepted work, rejection of impossible prefilled work, and per-task expiry events. Custom queue implementations must adopt the new pruning return contract; see the source changelog and canonical specs for migration details.\n\nCandidate: `53682521cb2a7a49c06e046c826890d9e11b6bfe`. Signed tag: `v0.4.0`, annotated object `943c62d860e8971847334e9196ad34881658fbcb`.\n\n[Trusted certification](https://github.com/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/actions/runs/40195944814) passed all 17 adopted scenarios, eight profiles, baseline, independent R2 review and operator gates. Main CI passed 84/84 jobs. Evidence includes PG17/18, redb, Iggy, real browser and mobile/desktop builds, plus an autonomous native macOS submit/process/quit/restart/retrieve observation and its negative control. These are scoped checks, not a universal reliability claim.\n\n[Final release rehearsal](https://github.com/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/actions/runs/40205610362) validated the exact certification, candidate and signature without publishing. [Publication workflow](https://github.com/Prometheus-AGS/prometheus-parking-lot-rs/actions/runs/40205691112) uses restricted crates.io OIDC authority. Registry checksum/VCS and fresh anonymous native/WASM consumer evidence accompanies the completed release record.\n\nKnown costs and limits: the quiet comparison classified 20 normal-path regressions, one improvement and 19 inconclusive intervals; duplicate-mailbox p50 was about 1.9–2.3 times baseline. Those measured costs were explicitly accepted under the delegated release decision; no performance gain or cause diagnosis is asserted. The website dependency audit still reports 39 findings (18 critical, 18 moderate, three low); website files are excluded from Rust packages but its CI tooling remains an integrity risk. The Iggy package inventory was checked separately because the inherited CI allowlist table omits its row. Credential rotation, replacement of exposed KBD signing authority, history cleanup and cache removal remain deferred under #88; this release does not claim containment completion.\n\nThe changelog date 2026-10-24 is the immutable preparation date. Earlier source text describing authored fixtures as unexecuted is superseded by the dated certification above; those historical bytes were preserved rather than relabeled.\n"}